  "prompt": "Use case: identity-preserve. Create ONE independently articulated animation frame of the SAME chibi boy in image1. Image1 is same-direction idle identity/construction/camera reference ONLY; redraw the exact NEW casting pose below. Image2 is PRIMARY approved bright clean rounded Daoist chibi hand-painted style; ignore UI. Preserve the same side-profile face, brown tousled high tied hair, yin-yang jade gold ornament, plain teal ribbon, forehead diamond, charcoal gold-cloud short robe, ivory lining, jade yin-yang belt, black gold boots. Anatomical RIGHT hand grips ONE large black brush with white bristles and dark tip; one teal tassel hangs from HANDLE BUTT behind fist, never bristle collar. Anatomical LEFT hand holds ONE hanging BLANK ivory scroll with black gold rods and yin-yang charm. Exactly TWO pale cyan ink spirits beside scroll. Real separate fingers, two clearly articulated feet, no extra limbs or objects. Full body square actual transparent alpha PNG at least 1024x1024, ideally1254. Match image1 global head/body scale and camera; equivalent ground y1155 on1254, fixed feet for cast. Independently draw this pose, no copy/mirror/interpolation. Clear transparent edge with no colored fringe. No writing, particles, trails, ground or large effects.\nFRAME POSE (implement actual new joint positions; retain all above invariants): cast/E/15. RIGHT side profile. Ease nearly into ready posture with only a slight knee bend and attentive gaze right. Anatomical right hand brings the brush lower beside the waist, tip still a little above its resting guard; anatomical left wrist lowers the blank scroll to hip height. Exactly two spirits calm beside it, upper one at the top-rod level and lower one near the middle, their tails nearly settled. A faint hem fold remains; fixed root and no overall shift.\nImportant construction: do NOT copy the tassel at the idle brush's old position near the back of his head. Move the single brush tassel with the butt-cap beside the RIGHT WRIST, physically attached behind the fist. No beads/tassel on hair ribbon; no detached tassel. The TWO spirits are simple figures with no floating droplets or exclamation marks.",
